            <div class="section homepage-goals">
               		
               <h2>What’s Your Goal?</h2>
               		
               <div class="homepage-goals__intro">Every part of your story is unique. At Anoka-Ramsey, you'll find programs designed
                  to help you write your next chapter.</div>
               		
               <div class="homepage-goals__cta">
